DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Chaim Weizmann\, whose 1st Yah
 rzeit occurs on Friday\, October 30\, corresponding to the 21st of Cheshva
 n\, 5714.\n\nChaim Weizmann’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Thursday\, O
 ctober 29 and continues until sundown on the day of observance. It is cust
 omary to light a memorial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay yo
 ur loved one’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may thei
 r memory serve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
